{"sections":[{"slug":"tutorial-funAG","section":{"metadata":{"slug":{"Plain":"tutorial-funAG"},"ext":{"Plain":"md"},"title":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">函子式代数几何</span>"},"taxon":{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">教程</span>. "},"author":{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"/SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},"page-title":{"Plain":"函子式代数几何"},"data-taxon":{"Plain":"教程"}},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数几何","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">代数几何</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">起源于这样一个见解</span>:\n<span lang=\"zh\">代数对象</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">如环</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">与几何对象</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">如拓扑空间</span>) <span lang=\"zh\">之间存在某种</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/代数-几何对偶","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">对偶</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">关系</span>.\n<span lang=\"zh\">每个环都应当视为某个空间上的函数环</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">这个空间即所谓</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/仿射概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">仿射概形</span>"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">代数几何的基本概念是概形</span>. "},{"Local":{"url":"/概形","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">概形</span>"}},{"Plain":"<span lang=\"zh\">有两种逻辑上等价但直观截然不同的定义</span>:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">作为局部同构于仿射概形的</span>"},{"Local":{"url":"/局部环化空间","text":"<span lang=\"zh\">局部环化空间</span>"}},{"Plain":",</li>\n<li><span lang=\"zh\">作为环范畴到集合范畴的满足条件的函子</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><span lang=\"zh\">前者是多数经典教材</span> (<span lang=\"zh\">如</span> Hartshorne) <span lang=\"zh\">使用的定义</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">而后者是</span> Grothendieck <span lang=\"zh\">学派以及现代数学实践更常使用的观点</span>, <span lang=\"zh\">也就是本文介绍的</span><strong><span lang=\"zh\">函子式代数几何</span></strong>.</p>\n"},{"Embed":{"url":"/tutorial-funAG-aff.md","title":null,"option":{"numbering":false,"details_open":false,"catalog":true}}},{"Embed":{"url":"/tutorial-funAG-sh.md","title":null,"option":{"numbering":false,"details_open":false,"catalog":true}}}]}}}]}